range of scenarios

34
00:02:12,280 --> 00:02:16,240
than what benchmarks alone can provide.
Safety risks emerge

35
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:21,800
from interactions between capabilities,
creating a combinatorial challenge.
Individual

36
00:02:21,800 --> 00:02:26,129
capabilities like situational awareness or
deception appear manageable when

37
00:02:26,129 --> 00:02:30,409
measured in isolation, but their
combination creates emergent risks

38
00:02:30,409 --> 00:02:35,050
fundamentally different from either
capability alone. Models might recognize

39
00:02:35,050 --> 00:02:38,729
when they're being evaluated and
selectively hide capabilities during

40
00:02:38,729 --> 00:02:44,569
